@baseUrl = https://localhost:7700
@token = INSERT_CURRENT_USER_TOKEN
@schoolId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@operationId = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
@templatePath = ../.evidence/templates/PracticalJournal.docx

# Replace synthetic IDs and revisions with owner/API responses. Use a new operationId for each distinct command; retain it for exact retries.

### listDocumentTemplates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/document-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: document-example-01

### createDocumentTemplate
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/document-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: document-example-01
Idempotency-Key: {{operationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "PracticalJournal",
  "name": "DEMO school template"
}

### getDocumentTemplate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/document-templates/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: document-example-01

